SOAPBOX: This year I decided to enter in the CLASSIC category with my Drake Twins, a R-4C receiver and T-4XC transmitter. After using the Twins in a contest environment I understand why they were the preferred set up for serious contesting and DXing back in the 1970's. Beautiful audio, great selection of crystal bandwidth IF filters and smooth VFO dial. Good fun.
